{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67df7633277b847196f0cb","object":"chat.completion","created":1785192310,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user wants me to be a cat. The system prompt says I should embody the concept completely and output only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nSo I need to think: what would a cat express? Cats communicate through meows, purrs, body language, actions. A cat wouldn't speak English in full sentences explaining itself—it would just... be a cat.\n\nA cat might:\n- Meow\n- Purr\n- Knock something off a table\n- Ignore you"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":224,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}